to eat Polpetto. Polpetto ka smushi meat ball.'\nYou say, 'I can help you break them.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Walking on Eggshells'.\nWakkadon Polpetto clasps your hands with joy. 'SKII NA GLIM! Aakakaka, mu bring Polpetto eya pallo feeling! Polpetto will hope mu are not eaten.'\n\n---\n\nWakkadon Polpetto has been tasked with guarding the Onokiwan cave's north entrance from the hungry hawks and falcons flying around the area. Polpetto, unfortunately, is completely helpless against big, hungry birds. He is beyond grateful to have your help protecting the cave.\n1\\. Dispatch 6 of Firefall's frenzied birds 0/6 Firefall Pass\n> **Quest Text:** Kill the birds flying around the northern section of Firefall Pass.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n118 platinum 5 silver 6 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
