kiwans.\n1\\. Thin the horde of hungry saureks 0/10 (Firefall Pass)\n_>Slay the saureks and cinderlings around the canyon._\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n118 platinum 5 silver 6 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
