      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Firefall Pass [zone=1306]\n**Who:**\n- Khala Dun Ulra [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 120\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 24:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Pilfered Pouch of Salt [item=145131]\n- Shadeweaver Snake Skin [item=145132]\n- Tanglewood Tree Sap [item=145130]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Shadeweaver's Tangle [zone=1309]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Spiritist Feyla [npc=58613]\n- a pot of tree sap [npc=58856]\n- a pouch of salt [npc=58857]\n- a snake home [npc=58858]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Shadeweaver's Tangle (10 Points) [quest=12235]\n**Era:** | !Night of Shadows\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 6 15:36:03 2022\nModified: Sun Jun 29 16:18:16 2025 | | **Night of Shadows Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nKhala Dun Ulra [npc=58479] is located at +2952, -85 in Firefall Pass, next to the Shadeweaver's Tangle zoneline. He's on Find (Ctrl+F).\nThe task doesn't lock at any point and you can /taskadd players in the end & get credit outside of group. No need to be in zone either.\nYou say, 'Hail, Khala Dun Ulra'\nKhala Dun Ulra says, 'Halt! I am Khala Dun Ulra. My party traveled here from Shar Vahl to investigate the commotion in Firefall Pass. We didn't expect a catastrophe of this magnitude. Adventurer, do you know what [happened here]?'\nYou say, 'I heard that there was an earthquake that happened here.'\nKhala Dun Ulra mutters not-so-subtly under his breath, 'Well that would be called a moonquake, now wouldn't it?' He raises his voice again. 'That is helpful to know. Thank you, adventurer. One has to wonder what would cause a disaster so enormous that it would cleave this mountain in two. If only we had the forces to spare to investigate further; we're stretched rather [thin] at the moment. It feels like we're chasing our own tails some days.'\nYou say, 'Why are you stretched so thin?'\nKhala Dun Ulra says, 'There have been so many unusual developments lately. The Akheva are bolder, the shak dratha are scheming something, the grimlings are relentless, this moonquake was so sudden, and I hear there's some kind of fungal infection spreading through Paludal Depths and the ruins of Shadow Haven. In fact, on our journey here, we noticed something quite [troubling]. If we weren't under direct orders to search Firefall Pass, we'd have dealt with it ourselves.'\nYou say, 'What was so troubling?'\nKhala Dun Ulra says, 'There is a small group of graves in Shadeweaver's Tangle. To our dismay, the area was surrounded by shades.' He hangs his head in grief. 'Those shades were once Vah Shir like us. After they passed, dark magic corrupted their spirits and cursed their bones to roam Luclin. The only way to bring them peace is through a [ritual] involving the skeletal remains that bind them here.'\nYou say, 'I can help with the ritual.'\nKhala Dun Ulra's ears perk up. 'That's the first piece of good news I've heard in weeks. There is no task more honorable than bringing peace to the dead. You can enter Shadeweaver's Tangle through the tunnel next to me. The graves are rather close to the location you'll arrive in. After you scope out the area, I recommend you seek out Spiritist Feyla. Feyla knows much about this predicament and can ensure you've properly laid our people to rest.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'No Grave Can Hold Them Down'.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Find the graveyard in Shadeweaver's Tangle 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nThe graveyard is located outside the Firefall Pass zone out Task update at /loc 2540, 992, -192.\nNote you should kill undead and loot 20 (10+10) Vah Shir remains needed for steps in this task.\n2\\. Find and speak with Spiritist Feyla 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nSpiritist Feyla is located at +563, -1565, -172.38 in the camp near Shar Vahl.\nYou say, 'Hail, Spiritist Feyla'\nSpiritist Feyla says, 'Hail, traveler. I don't mean to be rude, but I'm a bit busy. Can you find someone else to [help] you?'\nYou say, 'Khala Dun Ulra sent me on a mission to perform a ritual on the shades in this area. He mentioned that you might help.'\nSpiritist Feyla says, 'Ah, that changes things. I and my fellow spiritists are aware of the shades you speak of. We can feel their pain, even from here. That's why we've built this bonfire; it is part of the sacred ritual Ulra mentioned to you. The dances we perform aren't for entertainment. They break the tether that spirits have to this world. By burning the physical [remains] of beings cursed with foul magic, we bring them peace and allow their spirits to move on. Hymnist Omiyad taught me to lead these rituals. He is much too busy these days.'\nYou say, 'I can bring you some remains to burn.'\nSpiritist Feyla says, 'That would be a tremendous help. We'll need the majority of a set of remains in order to dispel the dark magic upon it. How many skeletons do you think you can fit in those bags of yours?' Spiritist Feyla sizes you up. 'Let's start with ten?'\n3\\. Deliver 10 cursed Vah Shir remains to Spiritist Feyla 0/10 Shadeweaver's Tangle\n4\\. Discuss the situation with Spiritist Feyla 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\n5\\. Locate the bucket of tanglewood tree sap 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nRun over a pot of tree sap [npc=58856] at /way +2435,-1650,-161.35 to get a Tanglewood Tree Sap [item=145130] on your cursor. The pot of tree sap is on track.\n6\\. Deliver tanglewood tree sap to Spiritist Feyla 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\n7\\. Locate a pilfered pouch of salt 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nRun over a pouch of salt [npc=58857] at /way +1110,-270,-184.24 to get a Pilfered Pouch of Salt [item=145131] on your cursor. The pouch of salt is on track.\n8\\. Deliver the pilfered pouch of salt to Spiritist Feyla 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\n9\\. Locate a piles of rocks a snake might inhabit 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\nRun over a snake home [npc=58858] at /way -439,-972,-184.15 to get a Shadeweaver Snake Skin [item=145132] on your cursor. The snake home is on track.\n10\\. Deliver the snake skin to Spiritist Feyla 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\n11\\. Converse with Spiritist Feyla 0/1 Shadeweaver's Tangle\n12\\. Deliver 10 more cursed Vah Shir remains to Spiritist Feyla 0/10 Shadeweaver's Tangle\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n354 platinum 1 gold 6 silver 7 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** ? & Veludeus",
